---
layout: layouts/empty.njk
---

<main class="sm:container sm:mx-auto py-10 pb-5 px-4 text-l">
    <section class="mt-10 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="mt-4">
            <span class="leading-loose text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">Hi, I am Klaas Cuvelier.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
            I'm a software engineer and a runner.<br />
            I love solving problems and building things.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Occasionally, not consistently, I write about things and share them on this website.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 leading-relaxed">
        <ul class="mx-0 mb-20 list-none space-y-2">
            <li><a class="inline-block py-1" href="/about">More about me</a></li>
            <li><a class="inline-block py-1" href="/blog">Writing stuff</a></li>
            <li><a class="inline-block py-1" href="/running">Running things</a></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</main>

{% if homepage.showRecents %}
<section class="landing-blog">
    <h3>My most recent writings</h3>
    <ul>
        {% for post in collections.posts | head(-3) | reverse %}
        <li>
            <a class="post-link" href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
            <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <a href="{{ 'blog' | url }}">See more&hellip;</a>
</section>
{% endif %}
